# Density Compare
# Molybdenum (Mo) — real density 10.28 g/cm³. equal masses: Molybdenum vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Molybdenum Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 9.2mm color: #54b5b5 at (-20mm, 4.6mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 82.0 g — the water cube is the reference
